#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Fixed six-action HousePrice A2 bridge.

This is a one-shot CLI. The controller supplies a deployment file through fixed argv,
and the model supplies only one bounded JSON request on stdin. ORX remains lifecycle
authority; local files retain only attempt, identity, receipt, and final-lock facts.
"""
